1
00:00:01,800 --> 00:00:04,076
我们停掉了一个 container，也就是前端
We stopped one container, the frontend,

2
00:00:04,076 --> 00:00:06,643
又重启了它前面的 Web 服务器
and restarted the web server in front of it.

3
00:00:06,963 --> 00:00:11,293
API 的 container 还在运行，向量数据库也是
The API container is still up, and so is the vector database.

4
00:00:11,533 --> 00:00:15,800
可整个网站什么都不响应，连 API 的地址也一样
Yet the whole site answers nothing, the address of the API included.

5
00:00:16,033 --> 00:00:20,534
今天的谜题：API 明明在运行，为什么它的地址也不通了？
Today's puzzle: the API is running, so why is its address dead too?

6
00:00:20,854 --> 00:00:23,543
我们会在手动把它建出来以后回答
We answer it once we have built this by hand.

7
00:00:23,783 --> 00:00:27,371
目标在这里，也就是课上画的部署图
Here is the goal, the lecture's picture of deployment:

8
00:00:27,371 --> 00:00:32,421
你笔记本上的 container 搬到 Google Cloud 里的一台虚拟机上
the containers from your laptop move to one virtual machine in Google Cloud,

9
00:00:32,421 --> 00:00:34,215
port 80 是唯一的入口
with port 80 the only door.

10
00:00:34,535 --> 00:00:37,138
我们把它建两遍：先手动，再写成代码
We build it twice: by hand, then as code.

11
00:00:37,383 --> 00:00:42,354
在课程路线图上，标记已经移到了部署、扩展和自动化
On the course roadmap, the marker has moved to deployment, scaling and automation.

12
00:00:42,674 --> 00:00:45,362
到目前为止，一切都跑在你自己的电脑上
Everything so far ran on your own computer.

13
00:00:45,682 --> 00:00:47,282
用户需要的是一台服务器
Users need a server.

14
00:00:47,367 --> 00:00:51,194
你需要 cheese-app-v3，旁边放着你的 secrets 目录
You need cheese-app-v3 with your secrets folder beside it,

15
00:00:51,194 --> 00:00:53,569
还要一个开通了结算的 Google Cloud 项目
a Google Cloud project with billing,

16
00:00:53,569 --> 00:00:55,218
和一个 Docker Hub 账号
and a Docker Hub account.

17
00:00:55,538 --> 00:00:59,825
这会花真钱，所以每个部分最后都会把所有东西删掉
This costs real money, so each part ends by deleting everything.

18
00:01:00,067 --> 00:01:05,675
角落里的进度条标出 README 的哪一步，代码面板标出文件和行号
The tracker in the corner names the README step, code panels name their file and lines,

19
00:01:05,675 --> 00:01:09,027
黄色的 your turn 标签表示暂停一下，自己跑一遍
and a yellow tag, your turn, means pause and run it.

20
00:01:09,267 --> 00:01:13,336
如实说一句：我们录制用的机器没有 Google 账号
One honest note: our recording machine has no Google account

21
00:01:13,336 --> 00:01:14,963
也没有登录 Docker Hub
and no Docker Hub login.

22
00:01:15,283 --> 00:01:17,822
在自己的机器上能跑的都是真的
What runs on a machine you own is real;

23
00:01:17,822 --> 00:01:21,011
每个云端步骤都停在它第一个真实的报错处
every cloud step stops at its first honest error,

24
00:01:21,011 --> 00:01:22,899
我们会说你的会输出什么
and we say what yours prints.

25
00:01:24,033 --> 00:01:25,697
我们把目标好好画一遍
Let's draw the goal properly.

26
00:01:26,017 --> 00:01:29,194
浏览器把请求发到 port 80
A browser sends a request to port 80,

27
00:01:29,194 --> 00:01:33,744
nginx 在那里把页面交给 port 3000 上的前端
where nginx passes pages to the frontend on port 3000

28
00:01:33,744 --> 00:01:36,662
把数据请求交给 9000 上的 API
and data calls to the API on 9000.

29
00:01:36,982 --> 00:01:40,502
API 去问 8000 上的向量数据库
The API asks the vector database on 8000.

30
00:01:40,750 --> 00:01:45,657
课件上的箭头方向是反的；我们按请求实际走的方向画
The slide draws its arrowheads the other way; we draw requests the way they travel.

31
00:01:45,977 --> 00:01:47,982
课件上画了四个 container
The slide shows four containers.

32
00:01:48,302 --> 00:01:53,187
还有第五个：一个加载器，它把向量数据库填满一次，然后就退出
There is a fifth: a loader that fills the vector database once and then leaves.

33
00:01:53,433 --> 00:01:57,032
课上把手动部署分成四个阶段
The lecture splits the manual route into four stages:

34
00:01:57,032 --> 00:02:00,698
push image、配置 VM、部署 container
push the images, set up the VM, deploy the containers,

35
00:02:00,698 --> 00:02:02,734
再在前面放一台 Web 服务器
and put a web server in front.

36
00:02:03,054 --> 00:02:04,868
这就是我们第 1 部分的地图
That is our map for part 1.

37
00:02:05,116 --> 00:02:07,981
README 一开头是一个检查，不是命令
The README starts with a check, not a command:

38
00:02:07,981 --> 00:02:09,724
你的 container 都在本地跑着
your containers run locally.

39
00:02:10,044 --> 00:02:15,197
向量数据库已经起来了，API 在 port 9000 上显示文档页
The vector database is up, the API shows its docs on port 9000,

40
00:02:15,197 --> 00:02:18,386
前端在 3000 上显示首页
and the frontend its home page on 3000.

41
00:02:18,633 --> 00:02:24,329
说明一点：在这份代码上，/status 比文档页更适合用来检查 API
A small note: on this code, /status is a better API check than the docs page.

42
00:02:24,649 --> 00:02:28,532
它返回版本 3.0，所以你知道跑的是哪份代码
It answers version 3.0, so you know which code runs.

43
00:02:28,766 --> 00:02:34,035
如果你最近跟过第 18 讲，它现在讲的是重构过的 v2
If you followed lecture 18 lately, it now teaches a refactored version 2;

44
00:02:34,035 --> 00:02:38,004
这里你跑的是 v3，用的是这个 repo 自己的脚本
here you run version 3, with this repository's scripts.

45
00:02:38,250 --> 00:02:41,893
我们跟着 main 分支走，也就是课程网站链接的那个分支
We follow main, the branch the course site links;

46
00:02:41,893 --> 00:02:45,610
录制当天，它停在 2025 年 11 月的这个 commit 上
on recording day it was this November 2025 commit.

47
00:02:45,930 --> 00:02:49,066
README 会变；git log 能告诉你手上的是哪一版
READMEs change; git log shows which one you have.

48
00:02:50,200 --> 00:02:52,248
第 1 阶段：push image
Stage 1: push the images.

49
00:02:52,568 --> 00:02:56,249
在你的 Docker Hub 账号设置里创建一个访问令牌
Create an access token in your Docker Hub account settings;

50
00:02:56,249 --> 00:02:59,181
它是给脚本用的密码，所以千万别给人看
it is a password for scripts, so never show it.

51
00:02:59,417 --> 00:03:03,336
照 README 印的原样敲，登录会失败
Typed exactly as the README prints it, the login fails:

52
00:03:03,336 --> 00:03:06,542
syntax error near unexpected token newline
syntax error near unexpected token `newline'.

53
00:03:06,862 --> 00:03:09,712
尖括号对 shell 来说是重定向
Angle brackets are redirections to the shell,

54
00:03:09,712 --> 00:03:13,806
所以要把整个占位符换掉，连尖括号一起。更好的做法
so replace the whole placeholder, brackets included. Better:

55
00:03:13,806 --> 00:03:17,666
--password-stdin 参数让令牌不会进到你的 shell 历史记录里
the flag --password-stdin keeps the token out of your shell history.

56
00:03:17,900 --> 00:03:21,207
现在是 Docker Hub 脚本，每个服务目录里各有一个
Now the Docker Hub script, one in each service folder.

57
00:03:21,527 --> 00:03:27,159
第 11 行把用户名设成 dlops，也就是课程的账号：改成你自己的
Line 11 sets the user name to dlops, the course account: change it to yours.

58
00:03:27,400 --> 00:03:30,925
第 27 行创建并选中一个新的 BuildKit 构建器
Line 27 creates and selects a new BuildKit builder;

59
00:03:30,925 --> 00:03:34,035
脚本先构建一遍，再构建一遍来 push
the script builds, then builds again to push.

60
00:03:34,355 --> 00:03:42,803
API 的脚本为 AMD64 和 ARM64 构建；前端的脚本只构建 AMD64
The API script builds for AMD64 and ARM64; the frontend script, AMD64 only.

61
00:03:43,050 --> 00:03:46,805
在 frontend-react 里、在任何 docker shell 之外运行它
Inside frontend-react, outside any docker shell, run it.

62
00:03:47,125 --> 00:03:50,275
它打印出 dlops，创建构建器，然后构建
It prints dlops, creates the builder, and builds:

63
00:03:50,275 --> 00:03:51,875
Compiled successfully
Compiled successfully.

64
00:03:52,010 --> 00:03:54,788
这条警告是说，这次构建的结果只留在构建器的缓存里
The warning says this build stays in the builder cache.

65
00:03:54,967 --> 00:03:56,972
接着是 push：access denied
Then the push: access denied.

66
00:03:57,292 --> 00:03:59,588
我们不是 dlops，也没有登录
We are not dlops, and not logged in;

67
00:03:59,588 --> 00:04:03,095
换成你的用户名并登录后，这里会显示 pushed
with your name and login, this is where it says pushed.

68
00:04:03,333 --> 00:04:06,703
在 api-service 和 vector-db 里跑同一个脚本
Run the same script in api-service and vector-db;

69
00:04:06,703 --> 00:04:09,797
那两个双平台构建我们没有录
we did not capture those two-platform builds.

70
00:04:10,117 --> 00:04:14,862
这两个要为两种芯片构建，其中一种靠模拟
Those two build for two chip types, one of them emulated:

71
00:04:14,862 --> 00:04:17,525
api-service 会构建很久
expect a long api-service build,

72
00:04:17,525 --> 00:04:20,272
在 Linux 上，先注册 QEMU
and on Linux register QEMU first.

73
00:04:20,592 --> 00:04:23,325
暂停一下，三个都跑一遍，再去 Docker Hub 上看看
Pause, run all three, and check Docker Hub.

74
00:04:23,550 --> 00:04:26,237
跳过这个阶段，第 1 部分也照样能跑
Skip this stage and part 1 still works,

75
00:04:26,237 --> 00:04:31,059
用的是公开的 dlops image，比代码稍微旧一点
using the public dlops images, which are a little older than the code.

76
00:04:31,379 --> 00:04:32,879
如果你 push 了自己的
If you pushed yours,

77
00:04:32,879 --> 00:04:36,201
就在 VM 的命令里把 dlops 换成你的用户名
replace dlops with your user name in the VM commands.

78
00:04:37,350 --> 00:04:39,441
第 2 阶段：配置 VM
Stage 2: set up the VM.

79
00:04:39,761 --> 00:04:44,796
在控制台里用默认值创建一个 VM 实例
In the console, create a VM instance with the defaults,

80
00:04:44,796 --> 00:04:48,275
只是机器类型改成 N2D、磁盘 50 GB
except machine type N2D, a 50 GB disk,

81
00:04:48,275 --> 00:04:50,747
并允许 HTTP 和 HTTPS 流量
and HTTP and HTTPS allowed.

82
00:04:50,983 --> 00:04:56,851
这两个勾会加上网络标记 http-server 和 https-server
Those two ticks add network tags, http-server and https-server;

83
00:04:56,851 --> 00:05:02,439
默认防火墙只对带这两个标记的 VM 开放 80 和 443
the default firewall opens 80 and 443 only to VMs with them.

84
00:05:02,759 --> 00:05:06,557
从现在起，VM 运行时计费，磁盘只要存在就计费
The VM now bills while it runs, its disk while it exists.

85
00:05:06,800 --> 00:05:08,344
暂停一下，创建你自己的 VM
Pause, create yours,

86
00:05:08,344 --> 00:05:12,667
然后在 VM 实例列表里点 SSH 按钮连进去
and SSH in with the SSH button in the VM instances list.

87
00:05:12,987 --> 00:05:16,599
我们的 VM 是一个能从头录到尾的替身
Our VM is a stand-in we can capture end to end:

88
00:05:16,599 --> 00:05:19,749
一台全新的、没装 Docker 的 Debian 12 机器
a fresh Debian 12 machine without Docker.

89
00:05:20,069 --> 00:05:22,352
每条命令在你的 VM 上都一样
Every command is the same on yours.

90
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:27,677
用官方脚本安装 Docker：用 curl 下载，再用 sudo 运行
Install Docker with the official script: download it with curl, run it with sudo.

91
00:05:27,997 --> 00:05:30,841
它为 bookworm 加上 Docker 的软件源
It adds the Docker repository for bookworm

92
00:05:30,841 --> 00:05:33,821
装好引擎、buildx 和 compose
and installs the engine, buildx and compose.

93
00:05:34,633 --> 00:05:37,812
然后用 sudo docker --version 检查一下
Then check it with sudo docker --version.

94
00:05:38,132 --> 00:05:40,841
在这里暂停一下，在你的 VM 上装好 Docker
Pause here and install Docker on your VM.

95
00:05:41,083 --> 00:05:42,729
接下来建目录
Next, create folders:

96
00:05:42,729 --> 00:05:47,590
persistent-folder、secrets 和 conf/nginx，任何人都能写
persistent-folder, secrets and conf/nginx, writable by anyone.

97
00:05:47,910 --> 00:05:50,500
README 把这六条命令列了两遍
The README lists these six commands twice:

98
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:52,966
在你的 home 目录下跑一遍就够了
run them once, from your home directory.

99
00:05:55,667 --> 00:05:58,699
一个额外检查：这些目录属于 root
An extra check: the folders belong to root,

100
00:05:58,699 --> 00:06:02,366
但任何人都能往里写：只适合演示用的 VM
but anyone may write there: fine for a demo VM only.

101
00:06:02,686 --> 00:06:06,461
留在你的 home 目录里：后面的挂载用的都是当前目录
Stay in your home directory: later mounts use the current folder.

102
00:06:06,700 --> 00:06:12,041
现在是应用的密钥 gcp-service.json，用 echo 写进去
Now the app's key, gcp-service.json, written with echo; ours holds

103
00:06:12,041 --> 00:06:13,740
我们的只有占位符
just the placeholder.

104
00:06:14,060 --> 00:06:18,384
把你笔记本 secrets 目录里的 gcp-service 密钥粘贴进去
Paste in the gcp-service key from your laptop's secrets folder;

105
00:06:18,384 --> 00:06:20,375
第 2 部分会讲怎么生成
part 2 shows how to make one.

106
00:06:20,695 --> 00:06:22,295
千万别给人看，也别 commit
Never show or commit it.

107
00:06:22,500 --> 00:06:25,703
最后，创建 Docker 网络 cheese-app-network
Last, create the Docker network, cheese-app-network:

108
00:06:25,703 --> 00:06:29,583
一个私有网络，我们的 container 在里面按名字找到彼此
a private network where our containers find each other by name.

109
00:06:29,903 --> 00:06:31,823
暂停一下，把这三步跑一遍
Pause and run these three steps.

110
00:06:32,967 --> 00:06:34,844
第 3 阶段：container
Stage 3: the containers.

111
00:06:35,164 --> 00:06:39,538
先 pull Chroma 的 image，再停掉并删除旧的向量数据库
Pull the Chroma image, then stop and remove any old vector database.

112
00:06:39,858 --> 00:06:42,934
No such container 这个报错在这里是无害的
The error, No such container, is harmless here:

113
00:06:42,934 --> 00:06:45,618
|| true 让这一步可以放心重跑
|| true makes the step safe to run again.

114
00:06:45,867 --> 00:06:49,015
然后在 cheese-app-network 上以后台方式运行它
Then run it detached on cheese-app-network,

115
00:06:49,015 --> 00:06:53,995
发布 port 8000，restart always，并挂载一个数据目录
publishing port 8000, restarting always, with a data folder mounted.

116
00:06:54,315 --> 00:06:56,384
它的名字会记进电话簿
Its name goes into the phone book.

117
00:06:56,750 --> 00:07:00,431
一个额外检查：port 已经发布，心跳有回应
An extra check: the port is published, the heartbeat answers,

118
00:07:00,431 --> 00:07:03,086
录制时是 Chroma 版本 1
Chroma version one at the time of recording.

119
00:07:03,334 --> 00:07:06,150
现在是加载器，Run vector db cli 这一节
Now the loader, run vector db cli.

120
00:07:06,470 --> 00:07:08,542
它按名字找到数据库
It finds the database by name,

121
00:07:08,542 --> 00:07:11,099
也就是 cheese-app-vector-db，而不是按地址
cheese-app-vector-db, not by address.

122
00:07:11,419 --> 00:07:15,003
项目用的是 README 的默认值；改成你自己的
The project is the README's default; change it to yours.

123
00:07:15,250 --> 00:07:18,782
它下载数据，创建 collection
It downloads, creates the collection,

124
00:07:18,782 --> 00:07:23,079
载入 11 个文件：一共 14,356 个 chunk
and loads eleven files: 14,356 chunks in all.

125
00:07:23,399 --> 00:07:27,474
这些 embedding 是预先算好的，所以我们的占位密钥根本没用上
The embeddings come precomputed, so our placeholder key never mattered.

126
00:07:27,717 --> 00:07:31,472
加载器带着 --rm 运行，所以它退出后就没了
The loader ran with the --rm flag, so it exits and is gone.

127
00:07:31,792 --> 00:07:34,131
暂停一下，现在把两个 container 都跑起来
Pause and run both containers now.

128
00:07:34,250 --> 00:07:35,523
想一想
A question.

129
00:07:35,573 --> 00:07:37,165
加载器没了
The loader is gone.

130
00:07:37,215 --> 00:07:40,970
那 14,356 个 chunk 也没了吗？
Are the 14,356 chunks gone too?

131
00:07:50,117 --> 00:07:52,691
不会。加载器只是把它们发过去
No. The loader only sent them;

132
00:07:52,691 --> 00:07:54,889
它们待在向量数据库的 container 里
they sit in the vector database container,

133
00:07:54,889 --> 00:07:56,489
而那个 container 一直在跑
which keeps running.

134
00:07:56,709 --> 00:07:59,226
删掉它，加载器就得重新填一个新的
Remove it, and the loader must fill a new one.

135
00:07:59,467 --> 00:08:01,387
那存在里面的哪儿？
But where inside that container?

136
00:08:01,707 --> 00:08:04,337
有一个小疏漏：Chroma 存到 /data
A small slip: Chroma saves to /data,

137
00:08:04,337 --> 00:08:07,552
所以 README 挂载的目录一直是空的
so the folder the README mounts stays empty.

138
00:08:07,872 --> 00:08:11,665
要把数据留在 VM 的磁盘上，就改为挂载 /data
To keep the data on the VM disk, mount /data instead,

139
00:08:11,665 --> 00:08:15,531
重跑停止、删除和运行这几行，再跑加载器
rerun the stop, remove and run lines, then the loader.

140
00:08:16,667 --> 00:08:18,608
接下来运行 api-service
Next, run api-service.

141
00:08:18,928 --> 00:08:23,046
VM 上还没有这个 image，所以 docker run 会先把它 pull 下来
The image is not on the VM yet, so docker run pulls it first.

142
00:08:23,284 --> 00:08:26,361
两个挂载，persistent-folder 和 secrets
Two mounts, persistent-folder and secrets;

143
00:08:26,361 --> 00:08:30,025
port 9000；密钥路径；还有按名字找的数据库
port 9000; the key path; and the database by name.

144
00:08:30,345 --> 00:08:35,337
项目是 README 的默认值，bucket 名传了进去，但从来没用到
The project is the README's default, and the bucket name is passed but never used.

145
00:08:38,450 --> 00:08:40,942
日志显示 loading CNN model
The logs show loading CNN model,

146
00:08:40,942 --> 00:08:43,591
然后是 uvicorn 在 port 9000 上运行
then uvicorn running on port 9000.

147
00:08:43,911 --> 00:08:47,112
模型来自 GitHub 的一个 release，不是 bucket
The model comes from a GitHub release, not a bucket,

148
00:08:47,112 --> 00:08:49,821
所以我们的图把课件上的 bucket 画成了灰色
so our picture grays out the slide's bucket.

149
00:08:50,067 --> 00:08:53,551
而且这个 image 很大，在磁盘上大约 5 GB
And the image is big, about five gigabytes on disk,

150
00:08:53,551 --> 00:08:55,151
里面装着 TensorFlow
with TensorFlow inside.

151
00:08:55,367 --> 00:08:57,415
三个额外的 curl 检查
Three extra curl checks:

152
00:08:57,415 --> 00:09:02,706
根路径返回 Welcome to AC215，/docs 显示文档页
the root says Welcome to AC215, and /docs shows the docs page.

153
00:09:03,026 --> 00:09:07,612
/status 返回 404：公开的 image 比你的 clone 旧
/status says 404: the public image is older than your clone.

154
00:09:07,850 --> 00:09:10,794
README 接着给了一个交互式的版本
The README then offers an interactive variant.

155
00:09:11,114 --> 00:09:15,253
照原样运行会失败：api-service 这个名字已经被占用了
Run as written, it fails: the name api-service is in use,

156
00:09:15,253 --> 00:09:18,304
因为后台的那个 container 还在跑
because the detached container still runs.

157
00:09:18,550 --> 00:09:21,383
用 docker rm -f 删掉正在运行的那个
Remove the running one with docker rm -f,

158
00:09:21,383 --> 00:09:23,457
交互式版本就会打开一个 shell
and the variant opens a shell.

159
00:09:23,777 --> 00:09:27,553
这一步是可选的：我们 exit 出来，再把后台的那个启动起来
It is optional: we exit and start the detached one again.

160
00:09:28,850 --> 00:09:31,453
然后是前端，在 port 3000 上
Then the frontend, on port 3000.

161
00:09:31,773 --> 00:09:34,411
额外检查显示了标题
The extra check shows the title,

162
00:09:34,411 --> 00:09:38,203
Formaggio 和 API 的基础 URL /api-service
Formaggio, and the base API URL, /api-service,

163
00:09:38,203 --> 00:09:41,501
页面就在它自己的地址上调用它
which the page calls on its own address.

164
00:09:41,821 --> 00:09:43,421
暂停一下，两个都启动起来
Pause and start both.

165
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:46,747
第 4 阶段：在前面放一台 Web 服务器
Stage 4: a web server in front.

166
00:09:47,067 --> 00:09:50,691
反向代理给浏览器一个地址
A reverse proxy gives the browser one address:

167
00:09:50,691 --> 00:09:55,813
nginx 监听 port 80，把每个请求转发到 VM 内部
nginx listens on port 80 and forwards each request inside the VM.

168
00:09:56,050 --> 00:09:58,803
在 repo 的 nginx.conf 里
In the repository's nginx.conf,

169
00:09:58,803 --> 00:10:05,287
第 35 行的 location 块接住以 /api-service 开头的路径
the location block on line 35 catches paths that start with /api-service.

170
00:10:05,607 --> 00:10:09,255
它把这些请求交给 port 9000 上的 api-service
It passes them to api-service on port 9000.

171
00:10:09,500 --> 00:10:12,103
看那个地址的结尾：一个斜杠
Look at the end of that address: one slash.

172
00:10:12,423 --> 00:10:17,159
有了它，nginx 就把匹配到的前缀换成这个斜杠
With it, nginx swaps the matched prefix for that slash,

173
00:10:17,159 --> 00:10:21,895
所以 /api-service/status 到了 API 那里就只是 /status
so /api-service/status reaches the API as just /status.

174
00:10:22,133 --> 00:10:26,293
其余的请求都交给下一个块，也就是 3000 上的前端
Everything else goes to the next block, the frontend on 3000.

175
00:10:26,613 --> 00:10:30,219
两个目标都是 cheese-app-network 上的 container 名字
Both targets are container names on cheese-app-network.

176
00:10:30,467 --> 00:10:34,414
README 用一条很长的 echo 加单引号来写这个文件
The README writes this file with one long echo in single quotes.

177
00:10:34,734 --> 00:10:39,057
可文件里也有单引号，所以 shell 把 log format 吃掉了
But the file holds single quotes too, so the shell eats the log_format

178
00:10:39,057 --> 00:10:41,219
只剩下一个短横线和两个括号
and leaves a dash and two brackets.

179
00:10:41,517 --> 00:10:44,760
路由还能用，但访问日志就没用了
Routing still works, but the access logs are useless.

180
00:10:45,080 --> 00:10:49,965
改用带引号的 heredoc 来写：cat，同样的内容，最后是 EOF
Write it with a quoted heredoc instead: cat, the same text, then EOF.

181
00:10:50,200 --> 00:10:53,443
如果你用的是 echo，先用这种方式把文件重写一遍
If you used the echo, rewrite the file this way first.

182
00:10:53,763 --> 00:10:57,752
然后运行 nginx，挂载这个文件，发布 port 80
Then run nginx with that file mounted, publishing port 80.

183
00:10:58,072 --> 00:11:03,960
container 列表显示四个：port 80、3000、9000 和 8000
The container list shows four: ports 80, 3000, 9000 and 8000.

184
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:08,693
在 VM 实例列表里找到你的 VM 的外部 IP
Open the external IP of your VM, from the VM instances list,

185
00:11:08,693 --> 00:11:11,688
在浏览器里打开，首页就出来了
in a browser, and the home page appears.

186
00:11:12,008 --> 00:11:14,239
在 VM 上，curl 也一样
On the VM, curl agrees:

187
00:11:14,239 --> 00:11:18,216
200 OK，由 nginx 提供，标题是 Formaggio
200 OK, served by nginx, title Formaggio.

188
00:11:18,450 --> 00:11:24,381
/api-service 返回 Welcome to AC215：前缀在路上被剪掉了
/api-service says Welcome to AC215: the prefix was cut on the way.

189
00:11:24,701 --> 00:11:26,322
暂停一下，打开你的网站
Pause and open your site.

190
00:11:26,567 --> 00:11:27,840
想一想
A question.

191
00:11:27,890 --> 00:11:30,770
VM 上发布了 port 9000
Port 9000 is published on the VM.

192
00:11:31,090 --> 00:11:32,839
从你的笔记本能访问到它吗？
Does it answer from your laptop?

193
00:11:41,683 --> 00:11:47,934
不能。那两个勾只开了 80 和 443；没有规则开放 9000
No. The two ticks opened only 80 and 443; no rule opens 9000.

194
00:11:48,254 --> 00:11:50,361
VM 上的 port 9000 是开着的
Port 9000 is open on the VM

195
00:11:50,361 --> 00:11:53,950
但在网络边界上是关着的：唯一的公共入口
but shut at the network edge: one public door.

196
00:11:54,617 --> 00:11:55,975
现在回答开头的谜题
Now the puzzle.

197
00:11:56,025 --> 00:12:00,377
Web 服务器只在启动时查一次 frontend 和 api-service 的地址
The web server looks up frontend and api-service once, at start.

198
00:12:00,697 --> 00:12:05,104
前端停了，重启时这次查找失败并直接退出
With the frontend stopped, the restart fails that lookup and exits,

199
00:12:05,104 --> 00:12:07,011
API 的路由也跟着没了
taking the API route with it.

200
00:12:07,250 --> 00:12:11,943
先启动前端，再启动 nginx，网站又返回 200 了
Start the frontend, then nginx, and the site answers 200 again.

201
00:12:12,263 --> 00:12:15,509
启动顺序很重要，重启策略也很重要
Start order matters, and so does a restart policy,

202
00:12:15,509 --> 00:12:18,301
而只有向量数据库那条命令带了重启策略
which only the vector database command has.

203
00:12:19,700 --> 00:12:21,300
我们来数一数敲了什么
Let's count what we typed.

204
00:12:21,535 --> 00:12:24,959
VM 上 21 条命令，加上控制台里的点击
Twenty-one commands on the VM, plus console clicks,

205
00:12:24,959 --> 00:12:27,913
再加上笔记本上的三个 Docker Hub 脚本
plus three Docker Hub scripts on the laptop.

206
00:12:28,233 --> 00:12:30,324
每一条都给 VM 加了一块积木
Each one added a block to the VM.

207
00:12:30,567 --> 00:12:32,167
现在有三个问题
Now three questions.

208
00:12:32,252 --> 00:12:35,964
重复：明天你能为一个 staging 副本建出一模一样的东西吗？
Repeat: can you build the same thing for a staging copy tomorrow?

209
00:12:36,284 --> 00:12:38,674
审查：那台 VM 上到底有什么？
Review: what exactly is on that VM?

210
00:12:38,994 --> 00:12:41,255
撤销：怎么把每一块都删掉？
Undo: how do you delete every piece?

211
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:47,153
课上用一个想法来回答：步骤太多，记不过来，所以让工具去做
The lecture answers with one idea: too many steps to keep track of, so let a tool do them.

212
00:12:47,567 --> 00:12:49,402
这就是基础设施即代码
That is infrastructure as code.

213
00:12:49,722 --> 00:12:55,750
你描述服务器、网络和软件，用的是一门真正的编程语言
You describe the servers, the networks and the software in a real programming language, Python here,

214
00:12:55,750 --> 00:12:57,594
这里是 Python，并放进 Git 里共享
and keep it in Git to share.

215
00:12:57,914 --> 00:13:00,409
没有 YAML 文件，也没有专门的语言
No YAML file, no special language.

216
00:13:00,650 --> 00:13:05,193
课程早先的一个版本用 Ansible playbook 做这几个阶段
An earlier version of the course did these same stages as Ansible playbooks,

217
00:13:05,193 --> 00:13:06,744
是用 YAML 写的
written in YAML.

218
00:13:06,794 --> 00:13:09,589
这个版本用 Pulumi 来做，一一对应
This version does them with Pulumi, one to one.

219
00:13:09,950 --> 00:13:12,529
还有一件 README 从来没说的事
One more thing the README never says:

220
00:13:12,529 --> 00:13:14,899
现在就删掉这台 VM，在第 2 部分之前
delete this VM now, before part 2.

221
00:13:15,219 --> 00:13:20,617
在控制台里打开 VM instances，选中它，连同启动磁盘一起删除
In the console, open VM instances, select it, and delete it with its boot disk.

222
00:13:20,937 --> 00:13:23,838
暂停一下，删掉你的；列表应该是空的
Pause and delete yours; the list should be empty.

223
00:13:24,083 --> 00:13:28,883
第 2 部分把这些全部用代码再建一遍，并让工具记住每一块
Part 2 builds it all again, as code, and lets a tool remember every piece.

224
00:13:30,033 --> 00:13:31,220
第 2 部分
Part 2.

225
00:13:31,270 --> 00:13:34,812
每个 Pulumi 程序说的是应该存在什么，而不是要做什么
Each Pulumi program says what should exist, not what to do.

226
00:13:35,132 --> 00:13:38,618
这个 repo 里的一条防火墙规则
One firewall rule from this repository:

227
00:13:38,618 --> 00:13:41,477
一个构造函数，compute.Firewall
a constructor, compute.Firewall;

228
00:13:41,477 --> 00:13:47,375
一个逻辑名，allow-http；还有参数：port 80，来源不限
a logical name, allow-http; and arguments: port 80, from anywhere,

229
00:13:47,375 --> 00:13:49,788
作用于带 http-server 标记的 VM
for VMs tagged http-server.

230
00:13:50,033 --> 00:13:52,956
课上那个 bucket 的例子也是同样的形状
The lecture's bucket example has the same shape.

231
00:13:53,276 --> 00:13:58,374
运行这一行什么都不会创建：构造函数只是注册这个资源
Running this line creates nothing: the constructor only registers the resource.

232
00:13:58,616 --> 00:14:04,095
这是课上讲 Pulumi 的那张图：命令行工具运行你的程序
This is the lecture's picture of Pulumi: the command line tool runs your program,

233
00:14:04,095 --> 00:14:07,747
程序产出期望状态，也就是一棵资源树
which produces the desired state, a tree of resources.

234
00:14:07,983 --> 00:14:11,260
Pulumi 还会加载它的 state，也就是它上次创建了什么
Pulumi also loads its state, what it created last time,

235
00:14:11,260 --> 00:14:12,754
放在你的 bucket 里
from your bucket.

236
00:14:12,804 --> 00:14:16,836
--refresh 参数会先拿这个 state 和实际存在的东西核对一遍
The --refresh flag first checks that state against what really exists.

237
00:14:17,083 --> 00:14:23,123
然后它比较期望状态和当前状态，每一处差异都变成计划里的一行
Then it compares desired with current, and each difference becomes a plan line:

238
00:14:23,123 --> 00:14:27,174
加号表示创建，波浪号表示更新，减号表示删除，加减号表示替换
+ to create, ~ to update, - to delete, +- to replace.

239
00:14:27,416 --> 00:14:29,594
最后它调用 provider
Finally it calls the providers,

240
00:14:29,594 --> 00:14:34,371
也就是 Google Cloud、Docker 等等的插件，由它们去调 API
plugins for Google Cloud, Docker and more, which make the API calls.

241
00:14:34,691 --> 00:14:39,832
课件上的横幅：Pulumi 通过云 API 管理基础设施
The banner on the slide: Pulumi manages infrastructure through cloud APIs.

242
00:14:40,066 --> 00:14:41,879
课上列了七个命令
The lecture lists seven commands.

243
00:14:42,199 --> 00:14:46,911
教程用了五个：stack、config、preview、up 和 destroy
The tutorial uses five: stack, config, preview, up and destroy,

244
00:14:46,911 --> 00:14:49,005
refresh 只作为参数出现
with refresh only as a flag.

245
00:14:49,325 --> 00:14:53,336
命令 new 是灰色的，因为两个项目都已经存在了
The command new stays gray, because both projects already exist.

246
00:14:53,583 --> 00:14:55,468
现在是 README 的命令
Now the README's command:

247
00:14:55,468 --> 00:14:58,106
pulumi up --stack dev --refresh -y
pulumi up --stack dev --refresh -y.

248
00:14:58,426 --> 00:15:00,516
命令 up 先预览，再询问，然后执行
Up previews, asks, then applies.

249
00:15:00,836 --> 00:15:02,756
参数 --stack dev 选定环境
Stack dev picks the environment.

250
00:15:03,076 --> 00:15:05,807
参数 --refresh 先让 state 和实际情况同步
Refresh syncs the state with reality first.

251
00:15:06,050 --> 00:15:10,271
-y 替你回答这个问题：do you want to perform this update
-y answers yes to the question, do you want to perform this update,

252
00:15:10,271 --> 00:15:12,791
也跳过了你检查计划的机会
and skips your chance to check the plan.

253
00:15:13,111 --> 00:15:15,031
第 3 步会告诉你这什么时候要紧
Step 3 shows when that matters.

254
00:15:15,351 --> 00:15:17,676
命令 preview 在任何改动之前就停下
Preview stops before anything changes.

255
00:15:17,916 --> 00:15:19,189
想一想
A question.

256
00:15:19,239 --> 00:15:21,863
你又跑了一次 pulumi up，什么都没改
You run pulumi up again and changed nothing.

257
00:15:22,183 --> 00:15:23,783
计划应该显示什么？
What should the plan show?

258
00:15:32,416 --> 00:15:33,753
什么都不用做
Nothing to do.

259
00:15:33,803 --> 00:15:38,064
期望状态等于 state，也等于实际情况，所以没有差异
Desired equals state equals reality, so there is no difference,

260
00:15:38,064 --> 00:15:40,971
什么都不会创建、修改或删除
and nothing is created, changed or deleted.

261
00:15:41,291 --> 00:15:45,152
先记住这一点：这个 repo 里有一个 stack 会打破这条规则
Hold that thought: one stack in this repository breaks the rule.

262
00:15:46,300 --> 00:15:49,448
课上把自动化部署分成六步
The lecture splits the automated deployment

263
00:15:49,448 --> 00:15:54,940
设置、image、VM、provisioning、container 和 Web 服务器
into six steps: setup, images, VM, provisioning, containers and web server.

264
00:15:55,260 --> 00:15:58,076
每一步对应一个文件；我们从第 1 步开始
Each maps to a file; we start with step 1.

265
00:15:58,317 --> 00:16:02,647
首先，启用四个 API：Compute Engine、Service Usage
First, enable four APIs: Compute Engine, Service Usage,

266
00:16:02,647 --> 00:16:06,189
Cloud Resource Manager 和 Artifact Registry
Cloud Resource Manager and Artifact Registry.

267
00:16:06,509 --> 00:16:10,370
应用的聊天还需要前几讲用过的 Vertex AI
The app's chat also needs Vertex AI, from earlier lectures.

268
00:16:10,617 --> 00:16:12,601
然后创建两个服务账号
Then create two service accounts.

269
00:16:12,921 --> 00:16:14,841
deployment 拿到六个角色
Deployment gets six roles,

270
00:16:14,841 --> 00:16:18,017
其中有 Compute Admin、Compute OS Login
among them Compute Admin, Compute OS Login,

271
00:16:18,017 --> 00:16:21,710
Artifact Registry Administrator 和 Storage Admin
Artifact Registry Administrator and Storage Admin.

272
00:16:22,030 --> 00:16:26,019
创建一个 JSON 密钥，改名为 deployment.json
Create a JSON key, and rename it deployment.json.

273
00:16:26,267 --> 00:16:29,560
第二个是 gcp-service，拿到三个角色
The second, gcp-service, gets three roles:

274
00:16:29,560 --> 00:16:33,166
Storage Object Viewer、Vertex AI Administrator
Storage Object Viewer, Vertex AI Administrator

275
00:16:33,166 --> 00:16:35,440
和 Artifact Registry Reader
and Artifact Registry Reader.

276
00:16:35,760 --> 00:16:38,896
它的密钥改名为 gcp-service.json
Its key becomes gcp-service.json.

277
00:16:39,133 --> 00:16:41,864
为什么要两个？deployment 负责建东西
Why two? Deployment builds things.

278
00:16:42,184 --> 00:16:45,226
它需要在你们组的项目上有管理员权限
It needs admin rights on your group's project,

279
00:16:45,226 --> 00:16:48,797
而不是 README 的默认项目，才能创建 VM 并登录进去
not the README's default, to create the VM and log in.

280
00:16:49,117 --> 00:16:51,805
窄权限的账号只负责运行
The narrow account only runs things:

281
00:16:51,805 --> 00:16:55,688
它读取 image 和存储的文件，并使用 Vertex AI
it reads images and stored files and uses Vertex AI.

282
00:16:55,933 --> 00:16:58,986
两个密钥都放进 clone 旁边的 secrets 目录
Both keys go into a secrets folder next to your clone,

283
00:16:58,986 --> 00:17:00,555
而不是 clone 里面
not inside it.

284
00:17:00,605 --> 00:17:06,301
下一步的部署脚本从 src/deployment 往上找三层目录，来找到它
The deployment script of the next step looks three folders up from src/deployment to find it.

285
00:17:06,621 --> 00:17:08,243
暂停一下，把你的密钥放好
Pause and place your keys.

286
00:17:08,483 --> 00:17:14,414
README 漏了一步：没有任何东西创建 Artifact Registry 仓库
One step is missing from the README: nothing creates the Artifact Registry repository.

287
00:17:14,734 --> 00:17:18,635
我们在下一步用一行额外的 gcloud 命令创建它
We create it with one extra gcloud line in the next step,

288
00:17:18,635 --> 00:17:21,031
等部署 container 跑起来以后
once the deployment container runs;

289
00:17:21,031 --> 00:17:22,947
跳过这一步，push 就会失败
skip it, and the push fails.

290
00:17:24,083 --> 00:17:27,207
README 没让你们每人各装一套不同的工具
Rather than each of you installing different tools,

291
00:17:27,207 --> 00:17:31,187
而是把它们打包进一个 container，也就是部署工具箱
the README packs them into one container, the deployment toolbox.

292
00:17:31,507 --> 00:17:36,286
在 docker-shell.sh 里，第 9 到 17 行设置它的环境
Lines 9 to 17 of docker-shell.sh set its environment.

293
00:17:36,933 --> 00:17:40,389
第 34 到 43 行把它接到你的笔记本上
Lines 34 to 43 wire it to your laptop.

294
00:17:40,709 --> 00:17:44,388
它们挂载 Docker socket，让它用你的 Docker 来构建
They mount the Docker socket, so it builds on your Docker,

295
00:17:44,388 --> 00:17:45,982
然后把 deployment 挂成 /app
then deployment as /app,

296
00:17:45,982 --> 00:17:49,776
再挂上 secrets、一份 Docker 配置和三个服务目录
the secrets, a Docker config and the three service folders.

297
00:17:50,550 --> 00:17:52,619
进到 src/deployment
Change into src/deployment.

298
00:17:52,939 --> 00:17:54,630
在 docker-shell.sh 里
In docker-shell.sh,

299
00:17:54,630 --> 00:17:57,745
把 GCP project 变量设成你的项目 ID
set GCP_PROJECT to your project ID;

300
00:17:57,745 --> 00:17:59,702
我们的是一个占位符
ours is a placeholder.

301
00:17:59,950 --> 00:18:02,915
现在按 repo 里的原样运行 docker-shell.sh
Now run docker-shell.sh, as committed.

302
00:18:03,235 --> 00:18:06,796
下载返回 404 Not Found，构建停下
Downloads answer 404 Not Found, the build stops,

303
00:18:06,796 --> 00:18:11,320
脚本却照样运行 container：pull access denied
and the script runs the container anyway: pull access denied.

304
00:18:11,566 --> 00:18:15,861
原因在第 4 行：基础 image 是 Debian 11，也就是 bullseye
The cause is line 4: the base image is Debian 11, bullseye,

305
00:18:15,861 --> 00:18:18,990
它的安全更新已经挪到了归档里
whose security updates moved to an archive.

306
00:18:19,310 --> 00:18:22,596
修复 1：把 bullseye 改成 bookworm，也就是 Debian 12
Fix 1: change bullseye to bookworm, Debian 12.

307
00:18:23,200 --> 00:18:26,571
再跑一次。这次停在第 29 行
Run it again. Now it stops at line 29:

308
00:18:26,571 --> 00:18:30,624
google-cloud-sdk has no installation candidate
google-cloud-sdk has no installation candidate.

309
00:18:30,944 --> 00:18:34,903
Google 给它改了名，apt 甚至直接说出了替代品
Google renamed it, and apt even names the replacement,

310
00:18:34,903 --> 00:18:36,333
google-cloud-cli
google-cloud-cli.

311
00:18:36,383 --> 00:18:38,644
修复 2：把两个包都改名
Fix 2: rename both packages.

312
00:18:38,964 --> 00:18:42,292
这是两处修复的真实 diff，各改一行
Here is the real diff of the two fixes, one line each.

313
00:18:42,612 --> 00:18:44,340
暂停一下，把两处都改好
Pause and make both edits.

314
00:18:45,066 --> 00:18:49,631
第三次运行大约 92 秒就构建好了，entrypoint 开始运行
The third run builds in about 92 seconds, and the entrypoint starts.

315
00:18:49,951 --> 00:18:53,066
第一个报错：Invalid grant: account not found
First error: invalid_grant: Invalid grant: account not found.

316
00:18:53,386 --> 00:18:57,952
我们的密钥不属于任何账号；你的会激活 deployment 账号
Our key belongs to no account; yours activates the deployment account.

317
00:18:58,200 --> 00:19:00,525
项目和 registry 辅助工具都通过了
The project and registry helper pass.

318
00:19:00,845 --> 00:19:05,709
然后是 state bucket：我们的没能创建，Pulumi 也没能登录
Then the state bucket: ours could not be created, and Pulumi could not log in.

319
00:19:06,029 --> 00:19:10,338
你的会在第一次运行时创建这个 bucket，登录，然后停在这里等你
Yours creates the bucket the first time, logs in, and leaves you here.

320
00:19:10,583 --> 00:19:14,039
检查一下工具：gcloud、Pulumi 和 kubectl
Check the tools: gcloud, Pulumi and kubectl.

321
00:19:14,359 --> 00:19:18,460
有个意外：kubectl 比 Dockerfile 固定的版本新
One surprise: kubectl is newer than the Dockerfile pins,

322
00:19:18,460 --> 00:19:24,208
因为 Google 的 apt 软件源有它自己的 kubectl 包
because Google's apt repository has its own kubectl package with a higher version,

323
00:19:24,208 --> 00:19:25,808
版本更高，apt 就选了它
and apt picks it.

324
00:19:25,950 --> 00:19:28,190
最后一个检查：gcloud auth list
Last check: gcloud auth list.

325
00:19:28,510 --> 00:19:30,705
我们的显示 No credentialed accounts
Ours says No credentialed accounts.

326
00:19:30,942 --> 00:19:34,005
你的会把 deployment 账号列为 active
Yours lists the deployment account as active;

327
00:19:34,005 --> 00:19:36,659
如果没有，就检查 secrets 里的文件名
if not, check the file name in secrets.

328
00:19:36,979 --> 00:19:41,395
然后用前面说的那行额外命令创建 registry 仓库
Then create the registry repository with the extra line from earlier.

329
00:19:41,715 --> 00:19:43,315
暂停一下，两个都跑一遍
Pause and run both.

330
00:19:44,250 --> 00:19:46,426
这是课件里唯一没讲的一项设置
This is the one setup the slides skip.

331
00:19:46,746 --> 00:19:52,015
Pulumi 会通过 SSH 登录 VM，去运行脚本、驱动 Docker
Pulumi will log in to the VM over SSH to run scripts and drive Docker.

332
00:19:52,335 --> 00:19:53,693
谁来登录？
Who logs in?

333
00:19:53,743 --> 00:19:57,280
deployment 服务账号，通过 OS Login
The deployment service account, through OS Login:

334
00:19:57,280 --> 00:20:01,900
VM 接受登记在这个账号个人资料里的密钥
the VM accepts a key registered to that account's login profile,

335
00:20:01,900 --> 00:20:05,221
用的是 Google 据账号生成的一个 Linux 用户名
under a Linux username Google derives from it.

336
00:20:05,467 --> 00:20:08,240
首先，为项目打开 OS Login
First, turn OS Login on for the project.

337
00:20:08,560 --> 00:20:11,995
照印的原样敲，这个模板会因为 no such file 而失败
Typed as printed, the template fails with no such file.

338
00:20:12,315 --> 00:20:16,453
又是尖括号那一课：把整个占位符换掉
It is the angle bracket lesson again: replace the whole placeholder.

339
00:20:16,700 --> 00:20:21,073
README 的例子用的是它自己的项目，你要改成你的
The README example uses its own project, which you change to yours.

340
00:20:21,393 --> 00:20:24,785
我们的显示 no active account；你的会输出 Updated
Ours says no active account; yours prints Updated.

341
00:20:25,033 --> 00:20:29,729
接下来是密钥：在 /secrets 里运行 ssh-keygen
Next, the key: in /secrets, run ssh-keygen with the name

342
00:20:29,729 --> 00:20:34,676
名字叫 ssh-key-deployment，按两次回车，再回到 /app
ssh-key-deployment, press Enter twice, and go back to /app.

343
00:20:34,996 --> 00:20:37,641
不设 passphrase：Pulumi 没法替你输入
No passphrase: Pulumi cannot type one.

344
00:20:37,900 --> 00:20:43,039
现在这两个文件就在你笔记本的 secrets 目录里
The two files now sit in the secrets folder on your laptop: the private key,

345
00:20:43,039 --> 00:20:45,879
私钥只有你能读，另一半是公钥
readable only by you, and the public half.

346
00:20:46,117 --> 00:20:49,253
然后把公钥上传到 OS Login 的个人资料里
Then upload the public half to the OS Login profile.

347
00:20:49,573 --> 00:20:51,559
我们的停在同一个报错
Ours stops at the same error;

348
00:20:51,559 --> 00:20:56,080
README 给出了你的输出，最后是一个以 sa_ 开头的用户名
the README shows yours, ending in a username that starts with sa_.

349
00:20:56,400 --> 00:20:59,023
复制下来：VM 那个 stack 的 config 要用它
Copy it: the VM stack's config needs it.

350
00:20:59,267 --> 00:21:03,619
有一个小疏漏：下一个小节让你编辑 inventory.yml
A small slip: the next heading asks you to edit inventory.yml.

351
00:21:03,939 --> 00:21:09,059
这个文件根本不存在；它属于课程早先用 Ansible 的版本
No such file exists; it belongs to an earlier, Ansible version of the course.

352
00:21:09,379 --> 00:21:11,405
Pulumi 的 config 取代了它
The Pulumi config replaces it.

353
00:21:12,650 --> 00:21:14,975
第 2 步：构建并 push image
Step 2: build and push the images.

354
00:21:15,295 --> 00:21:18,780
你笔记本的箭头落在 registry 上
Your laptop's arrow lands on the registry;

355
00:21:18,780 --> 00:21:22,598
课件第 21 页还叫它 GCR，这是它退役的旧名字
slide 21 still calls it GCR, its retired name:

356
00:21:22,598 --> 00:21:25,087
现在它叫 Artifact Registry
today it is Artifact Registry.

357
00:21:25,333 --> 00:21:29,366
Pulumi 用同一个程序的不同 stack 把环境隔开
Pulumi keeps environments apart as stacks of one program,

358
00:21:29,366 --> 00:21:31,347
dev、staging 和 production
dev, staging and production,

359
00:21:31,347 --> 00:21:33,824
每个都有自己的 state 和 config
each with its own state and config.

360
00:21:34,144 --> 00:21:37,109
教程每个项目只有一个 stack，就是 dev
The tutorial has one stack, dev, per project.

361
00:21:37,350 --> 00:21:41,001
它的全名 organization/deploy-images/dev
Its full name, organization/deploy-images/dev,

362
00:21:41,001 --> 00:21:44,731
会被 VM 那个项目用到，所以别改名
is used by the VM project, so do not rename it.

363
00:21:45,051 --> 00:21:47,507
每个 stack 的 state 都放在你的 bucket 里
Every stack state sits in your bucket.

364
00:21:47,557 --> 00:21:51,294
进到 deploy images，运行 pulumi stack init dev
Change into deploy_images and run pulumi stack init dev.

365
00:21:51,614 --> 00:21:53,114
没有登录 bucket 时
Without a bucket login,

366
00:21:53,114 --> 00:21:56,457
Pulumi 会推荐它自己的云服务，并等着浏览器
Pulumi offers its own cloud and waits for a browser.

367
00:21:56,777 --> 00:21:59,335
如果你的提示 stack 已经存在
If yours says the stack already exists,

368
00:21:59,335 --> 00:22:01,172
就用 pulumi stack select dev
use pulumi stack select dev.

369
00:22:01,417 --> 00:22:04,048
命令 config set、preview 和 up 都会打印
Config set, preview and up all print:

370
00:22:04,048 --> 00:22:06,324
Pulumi access token must be set
PULUMI_ACCESS_TOKEN must be set.

371
00:22:06,644 --> 00:22:09,625
为了还是能展示它们，我们用一个本地目录
To show them anyway, we use a local folder,

372
00:22:09,625 --> 00:22:12,745
pulumi login --local：这是额外步骤，你不用照做
pulumi login --local: extra, and not for you.

373
00:22:12,983 --> 00:22:15,803
命令 stack init 返回 Created stack dev
Stack init answers Created stack 'dev',

374
00:22:15,803 --> 00:22:19,853
config set 把你的项目写进 Pulumi.dev.yaml
and config set writes your project into Pulumi.dev.yaml.

375
00:22:20,100 --> 00:22:21,543
现在看程序
Now the program.

376
00:22:21,593 --> 00:22:25,107
第 13 行生成一个精确到秒的时间戳
Line 13 makes a timestamp, down to the second,

377
00:22:25,107 --> 00:22:28,697
第 14、15 行拼出 registry 的地址
and lines 14 and 15 build the registry address.

378
00:22:28,933 --> 00:22:32,533
每个 image 是一个 docker build Image 资源
Each image is one docker_build.Image resource:

379
00:22:32,533 --> 00:22:34,033
一个带时间戳的 tag
a timestamped tag,

380
00:22:34,033 --> 00:22:38,256
push 设为 true，retain on delete，还有一个平台，AMD64
push true, retain_on_delete, and one platform, AMD64.

381
00:22:38,576 --> 00:22:41,562
Apple 芯片的 Mac 模拟它会很慢
An Apple silicon Mac emulates that slowly.

382
00:22:41,882 --> 00:22:46,448
第 34、35 行把 tag 导出给另一个项目
Lines 34 and 35 export the tag for the other project.

383
00:22:46,683 --> 00:22:50,671
额外的 preview，只有前端：五个 provider 插件
The extra preview, frontend only: five provider plugins,

384
00:22:50,671 --> 00:22:53,876
一个要创建的 image 和它带时间戳的 tag
one image to create with its timestamped tag,

385
00:22:53,876 --> 00:22:56,582
还有一条警告：Skipping preview build
and a warning: Skipping preview build.

386
00:22:56,902 --> 00:22:58,502
一次 preview 从来不会构建
A preview never builds.

387
00:22:58,717 --> 00:23:02,646
命令 up 才会真的构建：npm install，Next.js 构建
Up does build: the npm install, the Next.js build,

388
00:23:02,646 --> 00:23:06,653
然后 push，在这里失败了，403 Forbidden
then the push, which fails here with 403 Forbidden.

389
00:23:06,973 --> 00:23:09,469
你的会把三个 image 都构建出来
Yours builds all three images, slowly,

390
00:23:09,469 --> 00:23:11,965
很慢，最后在输出里列出每个 tag
and ends with each tag in the outputs.

391
00:23:12,285 --> 00:23:13,885
暂停一下，跑一遍
Pause and run it.

392
00:23:14,550 --> 00:23:16,257
还记得前面那个问题吗？
Remember the earlier question?

393
00:23:16,577 --> 00:23:18,372
这个 stack 打破了那条规则
This stack breaks the rule:

394
00:23:18,372 --> 00:23:22,891
每次 up 都会重新构建 image，因为时间戳每次都是新的
each up rebuilds the images, because the timestamp is new every run.

395
00:23:23,211 --> 00:23:27,649
每次运行都可能往 registry 里加 image 层，而存储是要花钱的
Each run can add image layers to the registry, and storage costs money.

396
00:23:28,983 --> 00:23:30,860
第 3 步：创建 VM
Step 3: create the VM.

397
00:23:31,180 --> 00:23:34,081
课件在它旁边画了一个网络共享
The slide draws a network share beside it;

398
00:23:34,081 --> 00:23:38,156
在这份代码里，那是第二块磁盘，挂载在 /mnt/disk-1
in this code that is a second disk, mounted at /mnt/disk-1.

399
00:23:38,900 --> 00:23:40,900
进到 deploy single VM
Change into deploy_single_vm,

400
00:23:40,900 --> 00:23:44,418
然后 stack init、三次 config set、preview 和 up
then stack init, three config sets, preview and up:

401
00:23:44,418 --> 00:23:48,073
没有登录 bucket，每一个都打印同样的报错
without the bucket login, each prints the same error.

402
00:23:48,700 --> 00:23:53,790
在本地 backend 上，config 显示项目、你被遮住的用户名
On the local backend, the config shows the project, your masked username,

403
00:23:53,790 --> 00:23:55,951
以及 VM 运行时用的账号
and the account the VM runs as:

404
00:23:55,951 --> 00:23:59,367
你自己项目里的 deployment，不是 README 的
deployment at your own project, not the README's.

405
00:23:59,687 --> 00:24:03,228
暂停一下，三个都设好，再用 pulumi config 检查
Pause, set all three, and check them with pulumi config.

406
00:24:03,966 --> 00:24:07,434
主文件按课上的顺序做四次调用
The main file makes four calls, in the lecture's order:

407
00:24:07,434 --> 00:24:12,478
创建实例、provision 实例、设置 container、设置 Web 服务器
create the instance, provision it, set up the containers, set up the web server.

408
00:24:13,216 --> 00:24:15,840
在 create instance 里，先把围栏建好
Create instance builds the fences first.

409
00:24:16,160 --> 00:24:22,998
有一个云网络，也叫 cheese-app-network，还有三道防火墙门
There is a cloud network, also called cheese-app-network, and three firewall gates:

410
00:24:22,998 --> 00:24:26,870
给带标记的 VM 开 80 和 443，给所有 VM 开 22
80 and 443 for the tagged VMs, 22 for every VM.

411
00:24:27,116 --> 00:24:32,065
然后是一块 50 GB 的数据磁盘，以及查找最新的 Ubuntu image
Then a 50 GB data disk, and a lookup of the newest Ubuntu image.

412
00:24:32,385 --> 00:24:37,954
VM 的地址是一个输出，一个密封的信封，等 VM 存在了才会打开
The VM address is an output, a sealed envelope that opens once the VM exists.

413
00:24:38,200 --> 00:24:42,524
真正的 preview 计划了一块磁盘、一个网络和三条防火墙规则
The real preview plans a disk, a network and three firewalls,

414
00:24:42,524 --> 00:24:45,217
然后停在第 100 行，Invalid grant
then stops at line 100, invalid_grant:

415
00:24:45,217 --> 00:24:48,760
image 查找是第一个需要 Google 的调用
the image lookup is the first call needing Google.

416
00:24:49,080 --> 00:24:51,704
你的会继续，一共大约三十个资源
Yours goes on to about thirty resources.

417
00:24:51,950 --> 00:24:53,898
在 -y 之前先检查计划
Check the plan before -y:

418
00:24:53,898 --> 00:24:58,883
更新的 Ubuntu image 可能让下一次 up 变成替换 VM
a newer Ubuntu image can turn the next up into a VM replacement.

419
00:24:59,203 --> 00:25:00,803
然后暂停一下，运行 up
Then pause and run up.

420
00:25:00,931 --> 00:25:03,622
从这里开始就要花钱了，大约每天两美元
From here it costs roughly two dollars a day,

421
00:25:03,622 --> 00:25:05,222
另加磁盘和外部 IP 的费用
plus disks and an address.

422
00:25:05,916 --> 00:25:09,456
第 4 步 provisioning 在课件上没有图
Step 4, provisioning, has no slide picture:

423
00:25:09,456 --> 00:25:12,337
它发生在 VM 内部，通过 SSH
it happens inside the VM, over SSH.

424
00:25:12,657 --> 00:25:18,716
九条远程命令串成一条链：格式化并挂载磁盘、更新、安装 Docker
Nine remote commands run in a chain: format and mount the disk, update, install Docker.

425
00:25:19,266 --> 00:25:22,615
Pulumi 记得一条命令跑过，但不记得它改了什么
Pulumi remembers that a command ran, not what it changed.

426
00:25:22,935 --> 00:25:27,015
看第一条：blkid 检查有没有文件系统
Look at the first one: blkid checks for a filesystem,

427
00:25:27,015 --> 00:25:30,786
只有没有的时候，mkfs 才格式化磁盘
and only if there is none, mkfs formats the disk.

428
00:25:31,033 --> 00:25:32,306
想一想
A question.

429
00:25:32,356 --> 00:25:36,388
为什么先用 blkid 检查，而不是直接格式化磁盘？
Why check with blkid first, instead of just formatting the disk?

430
00:25:45,233 --> 00:25:47,025
因为格式化会清空数据
Because formatting erases.

431
00:25:47,345 --> 00:25:52,006
如果这一步哪天又跑了一次，在 trigger 变了或资源被替换以后
If this step ever ran again, after a new trigger or a replaced resource,

432
00:25:52,006 --> 00:25:56,796
直接格式化就会把数据磁盘清空：聊天记录和模型都没了
plain formatting would wipe the data disk: the chat history and the model.

433
00:25:57,116 --> 00:26:00,870
Pulumi 没法检查的脚本，必须跑两次也安全
Scripts Pulumi cannot inspect must be safe to run twice.

434
00:26:02,117 --> 00:26:03,909
第 5 步：container
Step 5: the containers.

435
00:26:04,229 --> 00:26:07,967
VM 的程序向 image 的 stack 要它的 tag
The VM program asks the images stack for its tags,

436
00:26:07,967 --> 00:26:09,836
通过一个 stack reference
through a stack reference

437
00:26:09,836 --> 00:26:12,378
指向 organization/deploy-images/dev
to organization/deploy-images/dev.

438
00:26:12,698 --> 00:26:15,002
所以先在 deploy images 里运行 up
So run up in deploy_images first.

439
00:26:15,750 --> 00:26:18,750
然后是一个 host 是 SSH 的 Docker provider
Then a Docker provider whose host is SSH,

440
00:26:18,750 --> 00:26:21,823
用你的密钥，这样 VM 上的每个 container
with your key, so each container on the VM

441
00:26:21,823 --> 00:26:25,116
都是一个 Pulumi 能比较和替换的资源
is a resource Pulumi can compare and replace.

442
00:26:25,850 --> 00:26:27,996
出现了三个 container
Three containers appear:

443
00:26:27,996 --> 00:26:33,274
前端，8000 上的向量数据库，9000 上的 API
the frontend, the vector database on 8000, the API on 9000.

444
00:26:33,594 --> 00:26:37,882
课件把前端放在 80；代码里是 3000
The slide puts the frontend on 80; the code, on 3000.

445
00:26:39,717 --> 00:26:41,530
第 6 步：Web 服务器
Step 6: the web server.

446
00:26:41,850 --> 00:26:46,309
最上面出现了 nginx 的 container，port 80 移到了它身上
The nginx container appears on top, and port 80 moves onto it.

447
00:26:49,234 --> 00:26:52,775
它的配置文件上传时带着一个校验和，作为 trigger
Its config file is uploaded with a checksum as a trigger.

448
00:26:53,095 --> 00:26:56,914
改了 nginx.conf，就只有这几步会重新运行
Change nginx.conf, and only these steps run again.

449
00:26:57,650 --> 00:26:59,975
我们没有录到成功的 pulumi up
No successful pulumi up was captured.

450
00:27:00,295 --> 00:27:03,090
所以这里是它会建出来的东西，照着代码画的
So here is what it builds, drawn from the code.

451
00:27:03,410 --> 00:27:06,952
最后是六个输出，其中有 instance IP
It ends on six outputs, among them the instance_ip.

452
00:27:07,200 --> 00:27:11,296
有一个小疏漏：导出的 SSH 命令漏了密钥
A small slip: the exported SSH command leaves out the key.

453
00:27:11,616 --> 00:27:15,136
加上 -i /secrets/ssh-key-deployment
Add -i /secrets/ssh-key-deployment.

454
00:27:15,884 --> 00:27:18,560
课上标出了每把密钥的职责
The lecture marks the job of each key:

455
00:27:18,560 --> 00:27:24,054
deployment 创建 VM 并登录，窄权限的密钥读取 image 和模型
deployment creates the VM and logs in, the narrow key reads images and models.

456
00:27:24,300 --> 00:27:25,573
想一想
A question.

457
00:27:25,623 --> 00:27:27,372
运行中的应用需要一把密钥
The running app needs one key.

458
00:27:27,692 --> 00:27:30,594
你会把哪一把交给 VM，为什么不给另一把？
Which would you hand the VM, and why not the other?

459
00:27:39,434 --> 00:27:41,106
gcp-service 的密钥
The gcp-service key:

460
00:27:41,106 --> 00:27:45,623
它能读 image 和存储的对象，能用 Vertex AI
it reads images and stored objects and uses Vertex AI;

461
00:27:45,623 --> 00:27:48,885
它不能创建 VM、磁盘或 bucket
it cannot create VMs, disks or buckets.

462
00:27:49,205 --> 00:27:53,002
deployment 能，而一台被攻破的 VM 绝不该拿着它
Deployment can, which a compromised VM should never hold.

463
00:27:53,250 --> 00:27:54,587
两个补充说明
Two footnotes.

464
00:27:54,637 --> 00:27:59,312
这个 repo 用你的 deployment 凭据 pull image
This repository pulls the images with your deployment credentials

465
00:27:59,312 --> 00:28:01,973
VM 本身也以 deployment 的身份运行
and runs the VM itself as deployment,

466
00:28:01,973 --> 00:28:05,858
只受 scopes 限制，也就是 VM 可以调用哪些服务的清单
capped only by scopes, a list of what the VM may call.

467
00:28:06,178 --> 00:28:09,805
而 API 用窄权限的密钥调用 Vertex AI
And the API calls Vertex AI with the narrow key.

468
00:28:10,125 --> 00:28:12,386
把窄权限的那把换上去，当作练习试试
Try the narrow one as an exercise.

469
00:28:12,634 --> 00:28:15,045
课上的最后一步：测试应用
The lecture's last step: test the app.

470
00:28:15,365 --> 00:28:20,612
打开你的 instance IP；页脚显示来自 /status 的 API 版本
Open your instance_ip; the footer shows the API version from /status.

471
00:28:23,684 --> 00:28:29,077
在 VM 上，通过控制台的 SSH 按钮或修好的 SSH 命令
On the VM, through the console's SSH button or the fixed SSH command,

472
00:28:29,077 --> 00:28:30,485
README 会检查
the README checks:

473
00:28:30,485 --> 00:28:34,628
列出 container，跟踪每个日志，按 Ctrl-C 停止
list the containers, follow each log, Ctrl+C to stop.

474
00:28:34,948 --> 00:28:38,596
我们的替身把数据库叫作 cheese-app-vector-db
Our stand-in names the database cheese-app-vector-db.

475
00:28:40,184 --> 00:28:43,491
用 exec 进到 api-service 和 nginx 里
Exec into api-service and into nginx.

476
00:28:43,811 --> 00:28:48,352
说明一点：聊天需要一个 Vertex AI 仍在提供的 Gemini 模型
One note: chat needs a Gemini model Vertex AI still serves;

477
00:28:48,352 --> 00:28:53,432
在 API 的辅助文件里改掉它，然后在两个项目里都运行 up
change it in the API's helper files, then run up in both projects.

478
00:28:54,667 --> 00:28:58,614
课上最后有专门的一页：别忘了删除
The lecture ends with a slide of its own: don't forget to delete.

479
00:28:58,850 --> 00:29:00,563
在 deploy single VM 里，运行
In deploy_single_vm,

480
00:29:00,563 --> 00:29:04,333
pulumi destroy --stack dev --refresh -y
run pulumi destroy --stack dev --refresh -y.

481
00:29:04,653 --> 00:29:06,253
暂停一下，跑你的
Pause and run yours.

482
00:29:06,445 --> 00:29:08,196
我们的显示登录报错
Ours shows the login error;

483
00:29:08,196 --> 00:29:12,738
在本地 backend 上，没有东西可删，一秒钟就结束了
on the local backend, with nothing to delete, it finishes in a second.

484
00:29:12,984 --> 00:29:15,408
pulumi destroy 把这张图倒着走一遍
Destroy plays the graph backwards:

485
00:29:15,408 --> 00:29:18,046
先是通过 SSH 部署的 container
the containers over SSH, then the VM,

486
00:29:18,046 --> 00:29:20,898
然后是 VM、磁盘、防火墙和网络
the disk, the firewalls and the network.

487
00:29:21,134 --> 00:29:23,164
在 deploy single VM 里运行它
Run it in deploy_single_vm;

488
00:29:23,164 --> 00:29:26,474
在 deploy images 里它只会忘掉这些 image
in deploy_images it only forgets the images,

489
00:29:26,474 --> 00:29:29,859
它们因为 retain on delete 还留在 registry 里
which stay in the registry, retain_on_delete.

490
00:29:30,100 --> 00:29:31,700
你的清理清单
Your teardown checklist.

491
00:29:31,913 --> 00:29:36,180
第一：destroy VM 的 stack，并确认 VM 列表是空的
One: destroy the VM stack, and check the VM list is empty.

492
00:29:36,500 --> 00:29:39,913
第二：用 gcloud 删除 registry 仓库
Two: delete the registry repository with gcloud.

493
00:29:40,233 --> 00:29:41,830
第三：state bucket，最后删
Three: the state bucket,

494
00:29:41,830 --> 00:29:44,159
等没有任何 stack 还占着东西的时候
last, once no stack holds anything.

495
00:29:44,400 --> 00:29:47,237
第四：第 1 部分的 VM，如果它还在运行
Four: the part 1 VM, if it still runs.

496
00:29:47,557 --> 00:29:50,864
第五：你的 Docker Hub image，免费，可删可不删
Five: your Docker Hub images, free and optional.

497
00:29:51,184 --> 00:29:54,555
第六：课程结束时，两个服务账号的密钥
Six: when the course ends, both service account keys.

498
00:29:54,800 --> 00:29:58,652
回顾就是课上的六步，每一步都有它的文件
The recap is the lecture's six steps, each with its file:

499
00:29:58,652 --> 00:30:00,747
docker-shell.sh、deploy images
docker-shell.sh, deploy_images,

500
00:30:00,747 --> 00:30:03,585
create instance、provision instance
create_instance.py, provision_instance.py,

501
00:30:03,585 --> 00:30:06,491
setup containers 和 setup webserver
setup_containers.py and setup_webserver.py.

502
00:30:07,750 --> 00:30:10,118
课上还列了六条原则
The lecture also names six principles.

503
00:30:10,438 --> 00:30:14,107
真正的编程语言、声明式、带预览的 state：有
Real language, declarative, state with previews: yes.

504
00:30:14,427 --> 00:30:16,689
组件和测试：这里没有
Components and tests: not here.

505
00:30:17,009 --> 00:30:19,559
provider 可以有很多，但这里只用了一个云平台
Many providers, but one cloud.

506
00:30:19,609 --> 00:30:21,887
一台 VM 就是单点故障
One VM is a single point of failure.

507
00:30:22,207 --> 00:30:25,343
第 21 讲把构建和测试自动化
Lecture 21 automates builds and tests,

508
00:30:25,343 --> 00:30:29,386
第 22 讲带着这个工具箱转到 Kubernetes
lecture 22 moves to Kubernetes with this toolbox,

509
00:30:29,386 --> 00:30:33,513
第 23 讲在 GitHub Actions 里运行 pulumi up
and lecture 23 runs pulumi up from GitHub Actions.

510
00:30:33,750 --> 00:30:35,129
自测一下
Test yourself.

511
00:30:35,179 --> 00:30:39,695
跟着你的 instance IP 加上 /api-service/status 走一遍
Trace your instance_ip/api-service/status: which gate,

512
00:30:39,695 --> 00:30:42,873
经过哪道门、哪个 container、哪个 location 块
which container, which location block,

513
00:30:42,873 --> 00:30:46,721
又是哪个字符让 API 看到的是 /status？
and which character makes the API see /status?

514
00:30:46,967 --> 00:30:49,689
命令 pulumi up 比较哪三样东西
What three things does pulumi up compare,

515
00:30:49,689 --> 00:30:52,876
refresh 改变什么，-y 又跳过了什么？
what does refresh change, and what does -y skip?

516
00:30:53,196 --> 00:30:57,335
说出两个服务账号的名字、每把密钥放在哪儿、各自能做什么
Name the two service accounts, where each key sits, and what each may do.

517
00:30:57,584 --> 00:31:02,683
六步里哪几步 Pulumi 之后能检查，哪几步它只是记得？
Which of the six steps can Pulumi inspect afterwards, and which does it only remember?

518
00:31:03,003 --> 00:31:04,603
跑完 destroy，什么还留着？
What survives destroy?

519
00:31:04,901 --> 00:31:08,080
答案在练习和学习指南里
Answers are in the exercises and the study guide.
